      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1628738974,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> We already have \"Compile BPFs\" for capture filters, does it make sense to have a similar button in UI for display filters to show this instructions?\n\nI'm not sure, I have never used \"Compile BPFs\", I don't know what it is used for.\n\nIf the use-case is to have a way to see compiled display filter bytecode in the GUI, I supposed it might be useful sometimes to troubleshoot some complicated expressions for advanced users. All the hard work is already done to support dftest anyway.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bea5f745397cf5a2fe0526df96ec143db47f9334340ab56515038832be57e976?s=80&d=identicon",
