      "title": "dfilter: Fix slices with byte references",
      "message": "dfilter: Fix slices with byte references\n\nBefore:\n\n    Filter:\n     frame[:2] == $@frame[:2]\n\n    Error: Range is not supported for entity @frame <FT_BYTES>\n      frame[:2] == $@frame[:2]\n                   ^~~~~~~\nAfter:\n\n    Filter:\n     frame[:2] == $@frame[:2]\n\n    Instructions:\n     0000 READ_TREE        frame            -> R0\n     0001 IF_FALSE_GOTO    7\n     0002 SLICE            R0[0:2]          -> R1\n     0003 READ_REFERENCE   ${@frame}        -> R2\n     0004 IF_FALSE_GOTO    7\n     0005 SLICE            R2[0:2]          -> R3\n     0006 ANY_EQ           R1 == R3\n     0007 RETURN\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
